[
  {
    "text": "Did you know\u2026",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 0.52
  },
  {
    "text": "that a tree grows in two directions at the same time?",
    "start": 0.52,
    "end": 3.26
  },
  {
    "text": "It\u2019s always growing down\u2026",
    "start": 3.68,
    "end": 4.66
  },
  {
    "text": "and growing up.",
    "start": 4.66,
    "end": 5.64
  },
  {
    "text": "And what\u2019s interesting is\u2014the root system mirrors the fruit system.",
    "start": 6.3,
    "end": 10.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Now, here\u2019s what\u2019s fascinating about a tree.",
    "start": 11.46,
    "end": 13.54
  },
  {
    "text": "Its nature is both gravitropic\u2026",
    "start": 14.26,
    "end": 15.98
  },
  {
    "text": "and phototropic.",
    "start": 15.98,
    "end": 17.2
  },
  {
    "text": "That means its roots grow away from the light\u2014",
    "start": 17.78,
    "end": 19.74
  },
  {
    "text": "and toward gravity.",
    "start": 19.74,
    "end": 21.1
  },
  {
    "text": "Before the tree can ever grow upward\u2026",
    "start": 21.92,
    "end": 23.26
  },
  {
    "text": "the seed must first grow downward.",
    "start": 23.8,
    "end": 25.5
  },
  {
    "text": "Into darkness.",
    "start": 25.5,
    "end": 26.46
  },
  {
    "text": "Resistance.",
    "start": 26.96,
    "end": 27.16
  },
  {
    "text": "Pressure.",
    "start": 27.82,
    "end": 28.06
  },
  {
    "text": "And dirt.",
    "start": 28.06,
    "end": 28.86
  },
  {
    "text": "The roots literally have to fight their way deeper underground.",
    "start": 28.86,
    "end": 32.36
  },
  {
    "text": "But once the tree breaks through the surface\u2026",
    "start": 32.8,
    "end": 34.66
  },
  {
    "text": "and begins reaching toward the light\u2026",
    "start": 34.66,
    "end": 36.88
  },
  {
    "text": "there is less resistance.",
    "start": 37.3,
    "end": 38.18
  },
  {
    "text": "And honestly\u2026",
    "start": 39.08,
    "end": 39.38
  },
  {
    "text": "That is one of the most beautiful pictures of how life works.",
    "start": 40.12,
    "end": 42.88
  },
  {
    "text": "Because the work you do in the dark\u2014",
    "start": 43.9,
    "end": 45.42
  },
  {
    "text": "when nobody sees you\u2026",
    "start": 45.68,
    "end": 46.66
  },
  {
    "text": "when life feels difficult and heavy\u2014",
    "start": 47.1,
    "end": 48.92
  },
  {
    "text": "is what creates the success people admire later\u2026",
    "start": 49.3,
    "end": 51.82
  },
  {
    "text": "in the light.",
    "start": 51.82,
    "end": 52.98
  },
  {
    "text": "Everybody wants the fruit.",
    "start": 53.86,
    "end": 55.28
  },
  {
    "text": "Everybody wants the visible success\u2026",
    "start": 55.98,
    "end": 57.96
  },
  {
    "text": "the recognition\u2026",
    "start": 57.96,
    "end": 58.7
  },
  {
    "text": "and the results.",
    "start": 58.7,
    "end": 59.68
  },
  {
    "text": "But very few people are willing to endure the lonely seasons\u2026",
    "start": 60.34,
    "end": 63.0
  },
  {
    "text": "that create them.",
    "start": 63.0,
    "end": 64.3
  }
]
